	;  MRP992  (06/27/2017) - Add %PROFILE/%PROFILE_ALL to SQL Code Generator
	;  JSL5071 (04/19/2017) - account for host variables being used in several places in SQL statement
	;  JSL5057 (04/07/2017) - use mt subscripts to record and pass data to Open, Close, and ShowPlan
	;  JSL5054 (04/01/2017) - Use ASL to trigger generation of code for Run Time Plan Choice outlier support RTPC
	;  JSL5032 (02/13/2017) - generation of run-time plan choice stubs for outliers
	;  JSL5024 (01/20/2017) - New array variable mtvar which maps mt("v") areas to expressions and their location in sql
	;  AK959   (01/12/2017) - Implement sharded multi-row INSERT
	;  AK957   (09/01/2016) - Implement sharded UPDATE and DELETE
	;  MRP875  (05/12/2016) - Reengineer & Optimize SQLStats Data Collection
