	;  AK840   (12/14/2011) - "findname" parsing for "rename" refactoring
	;  PVA242  (07/28/2011) - Support a hint (%noindex) to not use indexes to satisfy the indicated condition. 
	;  BJB470  (12/28/2010) - Record Compile Time as part of SQLStats
	;  BJB431  (11/13/2009) - Support SQLStats for one process
	;  DPV3387 (04/03/2009) - Correct Updatable view issue with subqueries
	;  DPV3384 (04/01/2009) - Support %%DEFAULTSCHEMA asimport item.
	;  DPV3369 (03/05/2009) - Report in contextdep() if there are reference to %CLASSNAME or %TABLENAME, unqualified names off for now
