	;  DPV3231 (08/05/2008) - Use process private global for ptln, ptrel
	;  DPV3227 (07/28/2008) - Implement "tablist" info compile
	;  DPV3164 (05/19/2008) - Remove INSERT code from cached queries
	;  DPV3131 (03/25/2008) - DD Lookup and Table compiler performance improvements
	;  DPV3122 (03/12/2008) - New logic
	;  DPV3116 (02/28/2008) - Support UPDATE & DELETE of Abstract class -> Polymorphic Dispatch
	;  DPV3076 (11/30/2007) - Changes to ^||%sql.smd lifetime, fixes for views updated WHERE CURRENT OF
	;  PVA149  (10/15/2007) - Restore support of arrow syntax from view columns in post 2007.1 versions
	;  BJB364  (10/01/2007) - Correct <UNDEFINED> caused by missing CursorName for non cursor queries.
